flowchart TD
    START[Customer selects a service] --> REQUEST[Create booking request]
    REQUEST --> VALIDATE{Server validates service, user, price, and state}
    VALIDATE -- No --> ERROR[Return safe error]
    VALIDATE -- Yes --> PROVIDER[Notify provider]
    PROVIDER --> DECISION{Provider accepts?}
    DECISION -- No --> REJECT[Booking rejected / request closed]
    DECISION -- Yes --> ACCEPT[Booking accepted]
    ACCEPT --> PAY[Create payment intent with approved PSP]
    PAY --> WEBHOOK[PSP sends signed webhook]
    WEBHOOK --> VERIFY{Signature + event ID + amount valid?}
    VERIFY -- No --> QUARANTINE[Reject / quarantine / alert]
    VERIFY -- Yes --> IDEMPOTENT[Idempotent event processing]
    IDEMPOTENT --> PAYMENTSTATE[Update payment state + ledger in DB transaction]
    PAYMENTSTATE --> INPROGRESS[Booking may proceed under policy]
    INPROGRESS --> SUBMIT[Provider submits work]
    SUBMIT --> CUSTOMERCONFIRM{Customer confirms or disputes?}
    CUSTOMERCONFIRM -- Confirms --> COMPLETED[Mark booking completed]
    CUSTOMERCONFIRM -- Disputes --> DISPUTE[Open dispute case]
    COMPLETED --> ELIGIBLE[Payout eligibility evaluated]
    ELIGIBLE --> PSPPAYOUT[Provider payout via PSP-supported flow]
    PSPPAYOUT --> RECON[Reconcile payout and settlement]
    DISPUTE --> REVIEW[Authorized staff review + audit trail]
    REVIEW --> RESOLUTION[Policy-based resolution / refund if applicable]
